## 🔌 REST API Endpoints

### Get All Products

```
GET /api/products
```

---

### Get Product Details

```
GET /api/products/{productId}
```

---

### Get Product Price History

```
GET /api/products/{productId}/price-history
```

**Sample Response:**

```json
[
  {
    "platform": "Amazon",
    "date": "2026-01-10",
    "price": 72999
  },
  {
    "platform": "Amazon",
    "date": "2026-01-11",
    "price": 71499
  }
]
```

---

### Get Today’s Prices (Optional)

```
GET /api/products/{productId}/today-prices
```

---

## 🎨 Frontend Responsibilities

Handled **entirely by frontend developer**:

- Product listing page
- Product detail page
- Platform-wise price comparison table
- Price history charts (Line Graph)
- API integration & error handling

🚫 Backend responsibilities **do NOT include UI or charts**

